SOAPBOX: was plenty to do. Could not really run to EU, but JA runs were decent. Had a
SOAPBOX: good 10m run to JA the last couple of hours. That was fun. 40 was good Friday
SOAPBOX: night, not as good Saturday night. Also had a decent 80m run to JA on Sunday
SOAPBOX: morning. Best contest there is in my opinion.
